<title>USA: Aetna to buy back up to 5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Aetna to buy back up to 5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aetna Inc said on Wednesday its board of directors authorized the company from time to time to repurchase up to five million shares of its common stock, which has a $0.01 par value per share.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it had about 150.9 million common shares outstanding as of Sept 30.</p>
<p>Aetna shares closed on Wednesday up 3-1/2 at 67.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk, (212) 859-1610</p>
